
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Motion Academy</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial;background:#f8fafc;color:#1e293b}
header,footer{background:#0f172a;color:white;padding:22px 6%}
header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap}
nav{background:#1d4ed8;padding:14px 6%;display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}
nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none}
.hero{padding:45px 6%;background:#dbeafe;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:25px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero-text{flex:1;min-width:230px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px);margin-top:0}
.hero-art{width:150px;height:150px;border-radius:30px;background:#2563eb;color:white;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:28px;font-weight:bold;animation:bounce 2s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
@keyframes bounce{from{transform:translateY(0) rotate(-5deg)}to{transform:translateY(-18px) rotate(5deg)}}
.label{display:block;background:#fff7ed;color:#9a3412;padding:8px;margin-top:14px;border:1px solid #fed7aa;border-radius:4px;font:12px monospace;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#2563eb;color:white;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:5px;animation:pulse 2s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{transform:scale(1)}50%{transform:scale(1.06)}}
section{padding:32px 6%}
.cards{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.card{flex:1 1 220px;background:white;padding:22px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:9px;animation:appear .8s ease both}
.card:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.2s}
.card:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.4s}
@keyframes appear{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
.card h3{margin-top:0}
.loader{height:12px;background:#dbeafe;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}
.loader span{display:block;width:35%;height:100%;background:#2563eb;border-radius:8px;animation:loading 2s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
@keyframes loading{from{width:10%}to{width:100%}}
.circle-row{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.circle{width:55px;height:55px;border-radius:50%;background:#7c3aed;animation:spin 3s linear infinite}
.circle:nth-child(2){background:#059669;animation-direction:reverse}
.circle:nth-child(3){background:#db2777;animation-duration:1.5s}
@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
@media(max-width:550px){.hero{align-items:flex-start}.hero-art{width:110px;height:110px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div><h2>Motion Academy</h2><small>Learn • Animate • Create</small></div>
<span>CSS Animation Learning</span>
</header>
<nav><a href="#home">Home</a><a href="#courses">Courses</a><a href="#practice">Practice</a></nav>
<section class="hero" id="home">
<div class="hero-text">
<h1>Bring Your Website to Life</h1>
<p>Learn how CSS animation creates movement without JavaScript.</p>
<a class="btn" href="#courses">Explore Courses</a>
<span class="label">Properties: animation; animation-duration; animation-iteration-count</span>
</div>
<div class="hero-art">CSS</div>
<span class="label">Properties: @keyframes; transform; animation-direction</span>
</section>
<section id="courses">
<h2>Animation Courses</h2>
<div class="cards">
<article class="card"><h3>Moving Elements</h3><p>Move elements using translate().</p><span class="label">animation: appear .8s ease both</span></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Color & Effects</h3><p>Change styles between animation stages.</p><span class="label">animation-delay; @keyframes</span></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Rotating Shapes</h3><p>Rotate shapes with transform.</p><span class="label">animation-direction; animation-duration</span></article>
</div>
</section>
<section id="practice">
<h2>Loading Animation</h2>
<p>Watch the progress bar move.</p>
<div class="loader"><span></span></div>
<span class="label">Properties: overflow: hidden; animation: loading 2s ease-in-out infinite alternate</span>
<h2>Rotating Shapes</h2>
<div class="circle-row"><div class="circle"></div><div class="circle"></div><div class="circle"></div></div>
<span class="label">Properties: animation; animation-direction; transform: rotate()</span>
</section>
<footer><strong>Motion Academy</strong><p>Practice CSS animation with small examples.</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
